    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d730">

                <pb facs="1255" n="1241" sameAs="frus:frus1950v06/pg1241"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">694.001/7–1150</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">Memorandum by the Director of the Office of Northeast
                        Asian Affairs</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic"
                            >Allison</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic">to the Consultant to
                        the Secretary</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic"
                        >Dulles</hi>)<anchor n="1" xml:id="d730-f1"/>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#float-left">
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">top secret</hi>
                    </seg>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">[<placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>,] <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1950-07-11">July 11, 1950</date>.</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>The attached draft security clauses for a Japanese peace treaty are based on a
                    previous draft prepared by Mr. Howard and a discussion among Messrs. Dulles,
                    Howard and Allison this morning. The language <pb facs="1256" n="1242"
                        xml:id="pg1242"/> in Article V is a paraphrase of language used by General
                    MacArthur in his supplementary memorandum of June 23.</p>
                <p>The paper will be discussed at the 4:30 meeting in Mr. Dulles’ office this
                        afternoon.<anchor n="2" xml:id="d730-f2"/>
                </p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>J[<hi rendition="#small-caps">ohn</hi>] M. A[<hi rendition="#small-caps"
                            >llison</hi>]</signed>
                </closer>


                <xi:include href="d730-a1.xml" xpointer="d730-a1"/>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
    <standOff>
        <listAnnotation>
            <note corresp="#d730-f1" n="1" type="source" xml:id="d730-f1-content">
                <p>Addressed also to Messrs. Rusk, Hamilton, Howard, and Fearey.</p>
            </note>
            <note corresp="#d730-f2" n="2" xml:id="d730-f2-content">
                <p>No minute of this meeting has been found in State Department files.</p>
            </note>
        </listAnnotation>
    </standOff>
